@startuml
!theme plain
title OpenData data governance and compliance
left to right direction
hide empty description

state "Source or dependency change" as Change
state "Licence / terms review" as Review
state "Security and privacy classification" as Classify
state "Documentation and notices" as Notices
state "Build / runtime evidence" as Evidence
state "Release decision" as Decision
state Gate <<choice>>

Change --> Review
Review --> Classify
Classify --> Notices
Notices --> Evidence
Evidence --> Gate : Mandatory controls satisfied?
Gate --> Decision : yes
Gate --> Change : no / remediate

note bottom of Gate
Checklists are not evidence by themselves.
Unresolved blockers require an explicit decision.
end note
@enduml
